OL,3,GNEWSA'I was given electric shocks to
OL,4,Aknock the homosexuality out of my
OL,5,Abrain'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd while the government said it would
OL,8,Fbe drafting legislation to ban
OL,9,F"aversion therapy", ten months on, the
OL,10,Fpeople spoken to by the BBC said they
OL,11,Fwere still yet to receive an apology
OL,12,Ffor what they had endured.
